{"sections":[{"slug":"Lie导数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Lie导数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Lie <span lang=\"zh\">导数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Lie 导数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$$\r\n\\iota_{[X,Y]} = \\mathcal L_X \\iota_Y - \\iota_Y \\mathcal L_X\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">形式</span> $\\omega$,\n$$\r\n(\\mathcal L_X\\iota_Y - \\iota_Y\\mathcal L_X)(\\omega)=X\\omega(Y)-\\iota_Y(\\iota_X d + d \\iota_X)(\\omega)=X\\omega(Y)-d\\omega(X,Y)-Y\\omega(X),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\iota_{[X,Y]}(\\omega)=\\omega([X,Y]),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">结论成立</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">注意到两边都是导子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故结论对所有形式成立</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}